  "goodToKnow": "Die Gesamtheit is the entirety or totality: in seiner Gesamtheit (as a whole), die Gesamtheit der Mitglieder. Gesamt means total: die Gesamtkosten, das Gesamtergebnis. Die Gesamtschule is a comprehensive school, an alternative to Germany's three-track school system. Gestalt psychology, from Germany, holds that the whole (das Ganze) is more than the sum of its parts. It has no plural."
